==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Arbok|48}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Arbok}}.
*'''Corner''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Houndour|43}} from the {{TCG|Neo Destiny}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

